# MCP Quotes Server

This project contains an MCP server that provides Star Trek quotes.

## MCP Server Configuration
- Command: npm start
- Working Directory: /Users/klaushofrichter/Development/mcp-1
- Resources Available:
  - quotes://all - All quotes as JSON
  - quotes://random - Random quote as JSON
  - quotes://text - All quotes as formatted text

The server uses the Model Context Protocol to serve quotes from quotes.json. 